Our public library is excited to announce a Saturday Repair Cafe starting at 10 a.m. this weekend! Join us for a community event where skilled volunteers help you fix household items and learn valuable repair skills. Whether you bring a broken lamp, a malfunctioning toaster, or any other damaged goods, our experts are here to help you restore them. Don't miss this opportunity to save money, reduce waste, and connect with your neighbors in a fun and educational setting.